cycle Ring

box plan as Decide
box work as Do
box look as Look back

step Decide
  say The steps declared with box lines sit on a ring clockwise from the top in the order written.

step Do
  say A line goes only to the next step on the ring, and its tag chip runs along the arc.
  plan -> work [tag: tasks]

step Look back
  say An arc the chip ran stays lit in the color of the receiving step.
  work -> look [tag: progress]

step Next round
  say A line from the last step to the first one starts the next round.
  look -> plan [tag: left]
